[00:00.000] 作词 : 方杰
[00:01.000] 作曲 : 侧田
[00:21.709]Love has never been far away
[00:26.459]It's easy for you to say
[00:32.461]I'm nothing but just a boy that's lacking love
[00:38.214]I wanted to stay away
[00:41.955]That's easy for you to say
[00:46.955]Yes I'm falling down the train
[00:51.454]Everybody's judging me and hating what I am
[00:56.710]But I don't care
[00:58.711]Even though I know my soul
[01:00.961]will never be the same again
[01:11.152]I just wanna make sure that you're safe
[01:14.396]Even though I know it's far too late
[01:18.160]You can put a knife inside me
[01:20.895]and I will feel the pain
[01:25.397]I just wanna make sure that you're safe
[01:28.895]And even though I know it's far too late
[01:33.397]I'm missing you
[01:38.904]God I'm missing love
[01:49.896]
[01:59.898]好 宁静的单身也好
[02:06.584]和自己一起跳舞
[02:11.596]无伴可分享 我可享受自豪
[02:17.083]其实怎么欺骗到
[02:21.095]才跟你尽力修补
[02:26.528]还是各有各的路
[02:30.533]日日夜夜悼念着旧录像旧合照
[02:35.781]来珍惜你
[02:37.769]像陌路便易妒忌
[02:40.019]寂寞亦不敢关注你
[02:44.018]
[02:44.527]I just wanna make sure that you're safe
[02:48.018]Even though I know it's far too late
[02:51.769]You can put a knife inside me
[02:54.530]and I will feel the pain
[02:59.272]I just wanna make sure that you're safe
[03:02.532]And even though I know it's far too late
[03:07.031]I'm missing you
[03:10.527]
[03:25.780]让我记得恋爱过的好
[03:28.782]话过会彼此度过苍老
[03:32.768]直到我只拥有记忆
[03:35.518]才发现你真的最好
[03:40.281]让我记得恋爱过的差
[03:43.771]曾仿佛吃苦都变了瑰宝
[03:48.023]I'm missing you
[03:51.519]从此只有我知道
